{
  "documents": [
    {
      "title": "Agreed editing scope",
      "text": "Project brief and quote\nSeller: Lira Venn, Philippines\nBuyer: Oren Vale\nProject: One YouTube video about balcony gardening\nAgreed fee: INR 12,000\nDelivery: Files and links to be handed over together after editing.\n\nAgreed requirements:\n- Deliver one finished video in 1080p MP4 format.\n- Create three custom thumbnail options.\n- Include licensed background music throughout the video.\n- Provide an SRT subtitle file in English.\n\nOren approved this brief before work began. The fee covers the listed deliverables and one round of minor corrections. The buyer supplied the footage and the spoken script. No additional platform uploads were included."
    },
    {
      "title": "Delivery handover",
      "text": "Hi Oren,\n\nThe balcony gardening edit is ready. I have placed the handover files in the shared project folder:\n\n- garden-final.mp4 — finished video, 1920 x 1080, MP4\n- thumbnail-a.png and thumbnail-b.png — two custom thumbnail options\n- garden-english.srt — English subtitles for the final cut\n\nThe third thumbnail option is still being revised and is not in the folder yet. The final video contains background music; I have also placed the music paperwork in the folder as music-license.pdf. Please check the cut and subtitle timing, and send any minor correction requests together so I can address them in one pass.\n\nThanks,\nLira"
    },
    {
      "title": "Post-delivery chat",
      "text": "10:12 Oren: I downloaded the MP4 and watched the full edit. The picture is clear and the pacing works for me.\n10:15 Lira: Glad it works. Did the subtitle file open correctly alongside the video?\n10:19 Oren: Yes, the English SRT loads and follows the spoken sections.\n10:23 Oren: I only see two thumbnail images. When will the last one be ready?\n10:27 Lira: I am still revising the third design and will send it separately.\n10:31 Oren: I also saw the music paperwork listed. I have not opened it yet.\n10:34 Lira: Please let me know if you need any minor corrections after reviewing everything."
    }
  ],
  "hypotheses": [
